# The build context of `docker build .` for Dockerfile.rocky, Dockerfile, and
# docker/Dockerfile.alpine.  Everything is excluded except what those copy in,
# which keeps out build/ (several GB) and other local files.  If a Dockerfile
# needs another file from the repo, add it here, or its COPY/ADD fails with
# "not found"
*
!src
!external
!.git
!CMakeLists.txt
!fpm.toml
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!utils/gen-header.sh
